Emphere EOL-PHP backports
=========================

This repository builds end-of-life PHP (7.4, 8.0, 8.1) with the official
upstream security fix for CVE-2026-109618 and CVE-2026-109619 ("php2shell")
applied.

The PHP source and the security patches are the work of The PHP Group and the
PHP core development team, distributed under the PHP License v3.01
(https://www.php.net/license/). The patches under patches/ are the unmodified
.patch of the corresponding php/php-src security commits. Emphere did not author
the security fix.

Emphere's contribution is the build harness (Dockerfile, build.sh), the test
run, and the signed, SBOM-accompanied artifacts. These are provided as-is, with
no warranty, as a convenience for operators running EOL PHP who cannot build
from source themselves.

